  "description": "Amber Oud Ultra Violet is an elegant floral fragrance that blends fresh rose and citrus with rich white florals and a smooth musky woody base. The scent feels feminine, refined, and slightly bold, with a balance between freshness and creamy floral depth. The opening introduces a bright mix of rose, bergamot, and ginger, creating a fresh, slightly spicy floral first impression. The heart develops into tuberose, jasmine, and white flowers, delivering a rich, creamy floral bouquet that feels soft yet luxurious. The base settles into musk, patchouli, and oak, leaving a smooth, slightly earthy, and long-lasting woody trail. Amber Oud Ultra Violet is perfect for women who enjoy bold white floral fragrances with a clean musky finish and a touch of spice.",
